Subject: [PATCH] feat(ai): wire up the AI training-tip feature
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

generateTrainingTip existed but was never called from the UI. Adds a
reusable TrainingTipCard (sport + focus selectors, "get tip" button,
graceful error handling via toast) shown in full on the Insights page and
as a compact teaser on the Dashboard. The server function now takes an
optional locale and answers in the active app language (de/en/uk).
Translation keys added for all three locales; LOVABLE_API_KEY documented
in .env.example. Additive only — no existing component was restructured.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WwagmzvYAcqWRzAJyQX1hV
